      "title": "How to use this tour",
      "description": "### Interview prep\n\nEach step is a question you're likely to get, with a short answer you can say, and the code that backs it up. Read the answer, then glance at the highlighted code to anchor it.\n\nThese are short on purpose. The tours behind them have the detail."
