      },
      "title": "What does ADAgentAI do?",
      "description": "**Q: What is ADAgentAI, in one minute?**\n\n**A:** A chat assistant for app publishers' ad accounts. You ask in plain English — *how much did I earn this week?* or *set up a mediation group* — and a LangGraph agent picks the right ad network and task, loads your real accounts, calls tools generated from Google's API descriptions over MCP, and streams the answer back. Anything that changes your account pauses for your approval first.\n\n**If they push:** Stack: Next.js 16 with a Hono API inside, Neon Postgres and Neon Auth, a FastAPI + LangGraph agent, MCP tool servers per network."
    },
    {
      "file": "backend/chat/graph/builder.py",
      "line": 157,
      "selection": {
        "start": {
          "line": 157,
          "character": 1
        },
        "end": {
          "line": 157,
          "character": 35
        }
      },
      "title": "Why LangGraph?",
      "description": "**Q: Why did you move from CrewAI to LangGraph?**\n\n**A:** What the code shows: explicit control of the flow (four nodes, conditional edges), state saved after every node so a run can pause for approval and resume, and fine-grained streaming of updates and custom events. Put your own reasons in your own words.\n\n**If they push:** The move happened on Jan 12, 2026, together with token tracking."
    },
    {
      "file": "backend/chat/graph/nodes/entity_loader.py",
      "line": 320,
      "selection": {
        "start": {
          "line": 320,
