      "title": "Streaming",
      "description": "**Q: How does the answer stream?**\n\n**A:** Server-Sent Events. The graph runs as a background task; text chunks and events go into two asyncio queues and out through one ordered SSE stream. The browser reads it with `fetch` and a stream reader, because `EventSource` can't POST or send a token."
    },
    {
      "file": "backend/chat/graph/nodes/specialist.py",
      "line": 66,
