        }
      },
      "title": "Cost and models",
      "description": "**Q: How do you control cost?**\n\n**A:** A cheap model at temperature 0 routes; the router also picks a path, and simple questions get the cheaper model. Tool lists are filtered by network and capability, then cut to the top 5 if more than 15 remain. Tokens and estimated cost are saved per message.\n\n**If they push:** The default provider is OpenRouter with Gemini 2.5 Flash for both roles; Claude is used only when `LLM_PROVIDER=anthropic`. Check what production ran before you claim a model."
    },
    {
      "file": "backend/chat/streaming/state.py",
      "line": 14,
